  m_text: "<size=20\n>- 8 Free Games are awarded.\n- While reels are spinning, one
    or more reels may expand by 1 or 2 rows.\n- The reels have              on them
    during <b><color=purple>Stampede</color> <color=red>Gold</color></b> Free Games.\n-
    The equivalent number of             will change to             on the\n   reels.
