  m_text: "<size=21>\n- 8 Free Games are awarded.\n- While reels are spinning, one
    or more reels may expand by 1 or 2 rows.\n- Wild becomes x2 Wild or x3 Wild randomly
    during <b><color=purple>Stampede</color></b> Free Games.\n- During <b><color=purple>Stampede</color></b>
    Free Games,            ,             and             are replaced with           
    .\n- 5, 8, 15 or 20 additional free games are awarded with 2, 3, 4 or 5 scattered           
    respectively. \n</size>"
